# R1 /rules-gen — catalogs directory placeholder.
#
# Curated YAML catalogs (bfsi-core, java, aws, ...) land in follow-up R1
# issues once R1-290 (catalog loader) and R1-291 (renderer) are in place.
# Each catalog file is named ``<slug>.yaml`` and conforms to the schema in
# ``primitives/rules_gen/SPEC.md`` §"Catalog YAML schema".
